    maxPlayers: 6,
    routePath: 'five-card-draw-jacks-back',
    LLM: 'Game: Jacks Back (Five Card Draw variant). Setup: Ante, deal 5 cards. Betting round (standard). Draw phase: discard and draw up to 5 cards. Exposure phase: each player may optionally turn one hole card face up. Final betting round. Showdown: highest 5-card Poker hand wins. Exposure mechanic: opponents see one of your cards before final betting, allowing them to adjust strategy.',
    Player: "Welcome to Jacks Back! Play Five Card Draw as usual: draw up to 5 cards. Then, here's the twist: you may choose to turn one of your hole cards face up. This information affects the final betting round. Best hand at showdown wins the pot.",
    tagline: 'Draw, expose one card, then bet. Information changes everything.',
    gameCategory: 'Poker',
    subcategory: 'Draw Poker',
    playerMode: 'multiplayer',
